{"availability":"available","full":"Asifdotexe/DORA","name":"DORA","description":"DORA (Data Oriented Report Automator) automates Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) to help you effortlessly explore datasets. Generate insightful statistics, visualizations, and reports with just a click! Streamline your data exploration workflow and uncover trends, patterns, and relationships in your data with ease.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":112,"forks":0,"created":"2024-05-22T17:39:20Z","updated":"2026-09-23T07:47:03Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://asifdotexe.github.io/DORA/","topics":["cli-tool","exploratory-analysis","html-report","pypi","python","streamlit"],"demo":"https://asifdotexe.github.io/DORA/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:46.388Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:46.388Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:46.388Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:46.388Z","stars":112,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An interactive power-tool to automate Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) and generate beautiful, insightful reports in seconds.","DORA is a tool that does the heavy lifting of data analysis for you. Instead of writing code to create charts and calculate statistics, you give DORA your data file, and it builds a comprehensive, beautiful HTML report automatically.","If you have used tools like ydata-profiling and sweetviz, DORA lets you do more. It provides a way to process kaggle dataset as well without a lot of clutter."],"features":["Web App: No installation needed. Just upload your data and download the report.","CLI Tool: Install locally for power usage and automation."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Asifdotexe/DORA/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"90f16885cd7e1a5faabcdf897a2123ae07df8eba94e3b0641bceeab4a6778d19","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:46.489Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:46.489Z","projectInsights":{"v